{"seq":3,"slug":"gadt-phantom-types","title":"GADT 与幻影类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/gadt-phantom-types","wordCount":1458,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"gadt-与幻影类型\">GADT 与幻影类型</h1><p>广义代数数据类型（Generalized Algebraic Data Types, GADT）和幻影类型（Phantom Types）是 OCaml 类型系统中最强大的类型级编程工具。它们允许在类型参数中编码精确的不变量，使编译器能够在模式匹配的每个分支中获得更精确的类型信息——从而将本应在运行时检查的约束提升到编译期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GADT 与幻影类型把类型级别的约束引入日常 OCaml 代码，其威力来自几条相互支撑的机制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心命题</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构造器精化返回类型</td>\n<td>GADT 的每个构造器返回类型参数不同的实例</td>\n<td>匹配某分支时编译器获得额外类型等式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部抽象类型</td>\n<td><code>type a.</code> 把类型变量当作函数体内的具体类型</td>\n<td>GADT 匹配必须写它，否则无法细化类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在类型</td>\n<td>构造器中存在量化但外部不可见的类型变量</td>\n<td>异构容器在保持类型安全的同时容纳异构元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幻影类型</td>\n<td>类型参数只出现在左侧、不占运行时空间</td>\n<td>用零成本的类型标记编码状态机与权限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：GADT 让「匹配哪个构造器」携带类型信息，幻影类型让「类型参数」携带状态信息，两者合力把运行时检查搬到编译期。下面依次展开 GADT 的机制与类型等式传播、存在类型、幻影类型的状态机编码，以及它们在实际工程中的限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gadt-的核心机制\">GADT 的核心机制</h2><p>普通变体的每个构造器都产出相同的结果类型。GADT 允许不同构造器返回类型参数不同的实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type _ expr =&#10;  | Int : int -&gt; int expr&#10;  | Bool : bool -&gt; bool expr&#10;  | Add : int expr * int expr -&gt; int expr&#10;  | Eq : &#39;a expr * &#39;a expr -&gt; bool expr&#10;  | If : bool expr * &#39;a expr * &#39;a expr -&gt; &#39;a expr\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type _ expr =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Int : int -> int expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Bool : bool -> bool expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Add : int expr * int expr -> int expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Eq : 'a expr * 'a expr -> bool expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | If : bool expr * 'a expr * 'a expr -> 'a expr</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键区别在于类型参数的约束方向——构造器的返回类型可以具体化类型变量，从而在匹配时为编译器提供额外的类型等式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let rec eval : type a. a expr -&gt; a = function&#10;  | Int n -&gt; n          (* 这里编译器知道 a = int *)&#10;  | Bool b -&gt; b         (* 这里编译器知道 a = bool *)&#10;  | Add (e1, e2) -&gt; eval e1 + eval e2  (* a = int，所以 + 合法 *)&#10;  | Eq (e1, e2) -&gt; eval e1 = eval e2   (* 返回 bool，匹配 a = bool *)&#10;  | If (c, t, f) -&gt; if eval c then eval t else eval f\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let rec eval : type a. a expr -> a = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Int n -> n          (* 这里编译器知道 a = int *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Bool b -> b         (* 这里编译器知道 a = bool *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Add (e1, e2) -> eval e1 + eval e2  (* a = int，所以 + 合法 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Eq (e1, e2) -> eval e1 = eval e2   (* 返回 bool，匹配 a = bool *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | If (c, t, f) -> if eval c then eval t else eval f</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>type a.</code> 语法——这是局部抽象类型注解，GADT 匹配中必须。没有它，编译器无法在每个分支中细化类型变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gadt-的类型等式传播\">GADT 的类型等式传播</h2><p>GADT 的威力源于编译器在匹配构造器时引入的类型等式（type equation）。当匹配 <code>Int n</code> 时，编译器知道 <code>a = int</code>；这个等式在该分支的作用域内有效：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type _ ty =&#10;  | TInt : int ty&#10;  | TString : string ty&#10;  | TList : &#39;a ty -&gt; &#39;a list ty&#10;  | TPair : &#39;a ty * &#39;b ty -&gt; (&#39;a * &#39;b) ty&#10;&#10;let rec show : type a. a ty -&gt; a -&gt; string = fun ty value -&gt;&#10;  match ty with&#10;  | TInt -&gt; string_of_int value        (* a = int *)&#10;  | TString -&gt; Printf.sprintf &quot;%S&quot; value  (* a = string *)&#10;  | TList elem_ty -&gt;                    (* a = &#39;elem list *)&#10;    let items = List.map (show elem_ty) value in&#10;    &quot;[&quot; ^ String.concat &quot;; &quot; items ^ &quot;]&quot;&#10;  | TPair (fst_ty, snd_ty) -&gt;          (* a = &#39;fst * &#39;snd *)&#10;    let (fst_val, snd_val) = value in&#10;    &quot;(&quot; ^ show fst_ty fst_val ^ &quot;, &quot; ^ show snd_ty snd_val ^ &quot;)&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type _ ty =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | TInt : int ty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | TString : string ty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | TList : 'a ty -> 'a list ty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | TPair : 'a ty * 'b ty -> ('a * 'b) ty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let rec show : type a. a ty -> a -> string = fun ty value -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match ty with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | TInt -> string_of_int value        (* a = int *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | TString -> Printf.sprintf \"%S\" value  (* a = string *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | TList elem_ty ->                    (* a = 'elem list *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let items = List.map (show elem_ty) value in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"[\" ^ String.concat \"; \" items ^ \"]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | TPair (fst_ty, snd_ty) ->          (* a = 'fst * 'snd *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (fst_val, snd_val) = value in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"(\" ^ show fst_ty fst_val ^ \", \" ^ show snd_ty snd_val ^ \")\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这实现了类型安全的通用序列化——无需 <code>Obj.magic</code>，编译器在每个分支中精确知道 <code>value</code> 的类型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;match ty with&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;| TInt -&gt;&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;| TString -&gt;&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;| TList elem_ty -&gt;&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;类型等式: a = int&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[&quot;value : int 合法&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;类型等式: a = string&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[&quot;value : string 合法&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;类型等式: a = &#39;elem list&quot;]&#10;    D1 --&gt; D2[&quot;value : &#39;elem list 合法&quot;]&#10;    D2 --&gt; D3[&quot;递归 show elem_ty&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"match ty with\"] --&gt; B[\"| TInt -&gt;\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"| TString -&gt;\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"| TList elem_ty -&gt;\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"类型等式: a = int\"]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[\"value : int 合法\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"类型等式: a = string\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[\"value : string 合法\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"类型等式: a = 'elem list\"]\n    D1 --&gt; D2[\"value : 'elem list 合法\"]\n    D2 --&gt; D3[\"递归 show elem_ty\"]</pre><h2 id=\"存在类型与-gadt\">存在类型与 GADT</h2><p>GADT 构造器可以引入存在量化的类型变量——这些变量在构造时确定但在外部不可见：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type any_expr = Any : &#39;a expr * &#39;a ty -&gt; any_expr&#10;&#10;let exprs : any_expr list = [&#10;  Any (Int 42, TInt);&#10;  Any (Bool true, TString);  (* 编译错误：类型不匹配 *)&#10;  Any (Add (Int 1, Int 2), TInt);&#10;]&#10;&#10;let show_any (Any (e, ty)) = show ty (eval e)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type any_expr = Any : 'a expr * 'a ty -> any_expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let exprs : any_expr list = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Any (Int 42, TInt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Any (Bool true, TString);  (* 编译错误：类型不匹配 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Any (Add (Int 1, Int 2), TInt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let show_any (Any (e, ty)) = show ty (eval e)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>存在类型的典型应用是异构容器——列表中的每个元素可以有不同的类型，但每个元素内部保持类型一致性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type formatter = Format.formatter&#10;&#10;type dyn_widget =&#10;  | Widget : {&#10;      state : &#39;s;&#10;      render : &#39;s -&gt; formatter -&gt; unit;&#10;      update : &#39;s -&gt; event -&gt; &#39;s;&#10;    } -&gt; dyn_widget\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type formatter = Format.formatter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type dyn_widget =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Widget : {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      state : 's;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      render : 's -> formatter -> unit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      update : 's -> event -> 's;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } -> dyn_widget</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"幻影类型\">幻影类型</h2><p>幻影类型是类型参数出现在类型定义的左侧但不出现在右侧数据中的技术。它们在运行时不占用任何空间，纯粹作为编译期标记：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type readonly&#10;type readwrite&#10;&#10;type (&#39;a, &#39;perm) buffer = { data : &#39;a array; mutable len : int }&#10;&#10;let create () : (&#39;a, readwrite) buffer =&#10;  { data = Array.make 16 (Obj.magic 0); len = 0 }&#10;&#10;let freeze (buf : (&#39;a, _) buffer) : (&#39;a, readonly) buffer =&#10;  { data = Array.copy buf.data; len = buf.len }&#10;&#10;let push (buf : (&#39;a, readwrite) buffer) (x : &#39;a) : unit =&#10;  buf.data.(buf.len) &lt;- x;&#10;  buf.len &lt;- buf.len + 1&#10;&#10;let get (buf : (&#39;a, _) buffer) (i : int) : &#39;a =&#10;  if i &gt;= buf.len then invalid_arg &quot;index out of bounds&quot;;&#10;  buf.data.(i)&#10;&#10;(* 编译错误：只读 buffer 不能 push *)&#10;(* let () = push (freeze buf) 42 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type readonly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type readwrite</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type ('a, 'perm) buffer = { data : 'a array; mutable len : int }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let create () : ('a, readwrite) buffer =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  { data = Array.make 16 (Obj.magic 0); len = 0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let freeze (buf : ('a, _) buffer) : ('a, readonly) buffer =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  { data = Array.copy buf.data; len = buf.len }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let push (buf : ('a, readwrite) buffer) (x : 'a) : unit =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  buf.data.(buf.len) &#x3C;- x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  buf.len &#x3C;- buf.len + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let get (buf : ('a, _) buffer) (i : int) : 'a =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if i >= buf.len then invalid_arg \"index out of bounds\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  buf.data.(i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 编译错误：只读 buffer 不能 push *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* let () = push (freeze buf) 42 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>幻影类型的本质是利用类型系统编码状态机——不同的类型参数代表不同的状态，只有合法的状态转换才通过类型检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幻影类型编码协议状态\">幻影类型编码协议状态</h2><p>一个更复杂的例子——用幻影类型编码 TCP 连接的状态机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type closed&#10;type listening&#10;type established&#10;&#10;type (_, _) socket_op =&#10;  | Bind : Unix.sockaddr -&gt; (closed, listening) socket_op&#10;  | Accept : (listening, established) socket_op&#10;  | Send : bytes -&gt; (established, established) socket_op&#10;  | Close : (_, closed) socket_op&#10;&#10;type &#39;s socket = { fd : Unix.file_descr; _state : &#39;s }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type closed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type listening</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type established</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type (_, _) socket_op =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Bind : Unix.sockaddr -> (closed, listening) socket_op</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Accept : (listening, established) socket_op</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Send : bytes -> (established, established) socket_op</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Close : (_, closed) socket_op</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type 's socket = { fd : Unix.file_descr; _state : 's }</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态转换</th>\n<th>前置状态</th>\n<th>后置状态</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绑定监听</td>\n<td><code>closed</code></td>\n<td><code>listening</code></td>\n<td><code>Bind addr</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接受连接</td>\n<td><code>listening</code></td>\n<td><code>established</code></td>\n<td><code>Accept</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发送数据</td>\n<td><code>established</code></td>\n<td><code>established</code></td>\n<td><code>Send data</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关闭连接</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td><code>closed</code></td>\n<td><code>Close</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在此设计下，试图在未建立连接的 socket 上发送数据会在编译期被拒绝——无需运行时状态检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gadt-与类型安全的异构列表\">GADT 与类型安全的异构列表</h2><p>GADT 可以用来构建类型安全的异构数据结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type _ hlist =&#10;  | [] : unit hlist&#10;  | ( :: ) : &#39;a * &#39;b hlist -&gt; (&#39;a * &#39;b) hlist&#10;&#10;let example : (int * (string * (bool * unit))) hlist =&#10;  [42; &quot;hello&quot;; true]&#10;&#10;let head : type a b. (a * b) hlist -&gt; a = function&#10;  | x :: _ -&gt; x&#10;&#10;let tail : type a b. (a * b) hlist -&gt; b hlist = function&#10;  | _ :: rest -&gt; rest\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type _ hlist =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | [] : unit hlist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | ( :: ) : 'a * 'b hlist -> ('a * 'b) hlist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let example : (int * (string * (bool * unit))) hlist =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [42; \"hello\"; true]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let head : type a b. (a * b) hlist -> a = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | x :: _ -> x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let tail : type a b. (a * b) hlist -> b hlist = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | _ :: rest -> rest</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这比使用 <code>Obj.magic</code> 或 <code>any</code> 类型安全得多——每个元素的类型信息完整保留在编译期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gadt-的限制与工程考量\">GADT 的限制与工程考量</h2><p>GADT 并非无代价——理解其限制对于正确使用至关重要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 限制 1: 无法自动推断 GADT 匹配的返回类型 *)&#10;(* 必须手写类型注解 *)&#10;let eval_wrong = function  (* 编译错误 *)&#10;  | Int n -&gt; n&#10;  | Bool b -&gt; b&#10;&#10;(* 限制 2: 穷尽性检查在某些 GADT 场景下不完善 *)&#10;(* 可能需要 refutation case *)&#10;type _ tag = A : int tag | B : string tag&#10;let f : int tag -&gt; int = function&#10;  | A -&gt; 42&#10;  (* | B -&gt; .  -- 这个 case 在类型上不可达 *)&#10;&#10;(* 限制 3: GADT 类型不能参与自动派生 *)&#10;(* ppx_deriving 对 GADT 支持有限 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 限制 1: 无法自动推断 GADT 匹配的返回类型 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 必须手写类型注解 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let eval_wrong = function  (* 编译错误 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Int n -> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Bool b -> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 限制 2: 穷尽性检查在某些 GADT 场景下不完善 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 可能需要 refutation case *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type _ tag = A : int tag | B : string tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let f : int tag -> int = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | A -> 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (* | B -> .  -- 这个 case 在类型上不可达 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 限制 3: GADT 类型不能参与自动派生 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* ppx_deriving 对 GADT 支持有限 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>考量维度</th>\n<th>普通 ADT</th>\n<th>GADT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型推断</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>需要手动注解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>穷尽性检查</td>\n<td>完善</td>\n<td>部分场景需 refutation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PPX 派生</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译错误可读性</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>较差（长类型等式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时开销</td>\n<td>无额外开销</td>\n<td>无额外开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>通用数据建模</td>\n<td>嵌入式 DSL、类型安全解释器、协议编码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战-类型安全的-sql-查询构建器\">实战：类型安全的 SQL 查询构建器</h2><p>将 GADT 和幻影类型结合，可以构建在编译期保证类型正确的 DSL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type _ column =&#10;  | Int_col : string -&gt; int column&#10;  | Text_col : string -&gt; string column&#10;  | Bool_col : string -&gt; bool column&#10;&#10;type _ expr =&#10;  | Col : &#39;a column -&gt; &#39;a expr&#10;  | Lit_int : int -&gt; int expr&#10;  | Lit_str : string -&gt; string expr&#10;  | Gt : int expr * int expr -&gt; bool expr&#10;  | And : bool expr * bool expr -&gt; bool expr&#10;  | Eq : &#39;a expr * &#39;a expr -&gt; bool expr&#10;&#10;let users_name = Text_col &quot;name&quot;&#10;let users_age = Int_col &quot;age&quot;&#10;let users_active = Bool_col &quot;active&quot;&#10;&#10;(* 类型安全：不能比较 string 和 int *)&#10;let valid_query = And (Gt (Col users_age, Lit_int 18), Col users_active)&#10;(* let invalid = Gt (Col users_name, Lit_int 18)  -- 编译错误 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type _ column =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Int_col : string -> int column</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Text_col : string -> string column</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Bool_col : string -> bool column</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type _ expr =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Col : 'a column -> 'a expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Lit_int : int -> int expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Lit_str : string -> string expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Gt : int expr * int expr -> bool expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | And : bool expr * bool expr -> bool expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Eq : 'a expr * 'a expr -> bool expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let users_name = Text_col \"name\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let users_age = Int_col \"age\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let users_active = Bool_col \"active\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 类型安全：不能比较 string 和 int *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let valid_query = And (Gt (Col users_age, Lit_int 18), Col users_active)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* let invalid = Gt (Col users_name, Lit_int 18)  -- 编译错误 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>GADT 让类型信息随构造器流动</strong>：不同构造器返回不同精化的类型实例，匹配分支时编译器获得相应类型等式。</li>\n<li><strong><code>type a.</code> 是必需配套</strong>：没有局部抽象类型注解，编译器无法在分支中细化类型变量；它也是连接一等模块存在类型的桥梁。</li>\n<li><strong>存在类型支撑异构容器</strong>：<code>Any : &#39;a expr * &#39;a ty -&gt; any_expr</code> 这类构造器把类型变量隐藏，同时保留元素内部的类型一致性。</li>\n<li><strong>幻影类型是零成本的类型标记</strong>：类型参数不出现在数据中、不占运行时空间，却能把状态迁移、权限、协议阶段编码进类型。</li>\n<li><strong>代价必须清楚</strong>：GADT 需要手动注解、穷尽性检查在部分场景需 refutation case、PPX 派生支持有限、编译错误可读性较差——适合嵌入式 DSL、类型安全解释器与协议编码，而非通用数据建模。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GADT 与幻影类型代表 OCaml 类型系统表达力的上限，它们把「消除非法状态」的理念推到极致，让编译器成为程序正确性的积极守护者。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GADT 与幻影类型","id":"gadt-与幻影类型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GADT 的核心机制","id":"gadt-的核心机制"},{"level":2,"text":"GADT 的类型等式传播","id":"gadt-的类型等式传播"},{"level":2,"text":"存在类型与 GADT","id":"存在类型与-gadt"},{"level":2,"text":"幻影类型","id":"幻影类型"},{"level":2,"text":"幻影类型编码协议状态","id":"幻影类型编码协议状态"},{"level":2,"text":"GADT 与类型安全的异构列表","id":"gadt-与类型安全的异构列表"},{"level":2,"text":"GADT 的限制与工程考量","id":"gadt-的限制与工程考量"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：类型安全的 SQL 查询构建器","id":"实战-类型安全的-sql-查询构建器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多态与类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/polymorphism-type-inference"},"next":{"title":"模块、签名与函子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/modules-signatures-functors"}}